## What to deliver

Build the pipe up operation by operation until the model in `model.png` matches the
brief — a heavy, riveted tube running the length of the volume along z, with a raised
flange collar and a course of bolt heads at each end, both ends flush so two spans
butt together cleanly. **Before you finish, run `voxel render`** so the geometry
(`mesh.glb`) the result is built from is emitted — an unrendered model is scored as
empty. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished
submission.
